Package: genesis-council
Version: 0.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: GENESIS contributors
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk
Description: Multi-LLM coding assistant for a project directory
 Genesis runs the Council orchestrator against the current project directory.
 It checks the local opencode installation, starts the GUI when no request is
 supplied, and passes explicit Council arguments through unchanged.
